{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# 伤害结算｜流程子图\n只画一次命中如何变为属性和表现。类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]；跨模块全链见 [[GGYGO_流程_战斗链路.canvas]]。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1660,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"window","type":"text","text":"1. GA 的 Montage Event 打开判定窗口。\n\n调用：PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent::OnGameplayEvent → BossMeleeAbility::HandleMontageEvent → MeleeTrace::BeginTraceWindow。","x":0,"y":351,"width":390,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"trace","type":"text","text":"2. MeleeTrace 沿上一帧到本帧武器轨迹扫掠，并在窗口内去重。\n\n调用：MeleeTrace::TickComponent → PerformTrace → OnMeleeHit.Broadcast(Target, Hit)；EndTraceWindow 收尾。","x":470,"y":351,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"effect","type":"text","text":"3. Player/Boss GA 调共享 BuildHitEffectPayload。\n\n命中回调时捕获 Avatar 位置为 Origin；Context 先 AddHitResult 再 AddOrigin。共享路径生成可选 Spec、表面/目标 Tag 与 Cue。调用方只填 SetByCaller 并尝试应用 GE。","x":960,"y":351,"width":410,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"execute","type":"text","text":"4. DamageExecution 捕获源输出和目标承受属性，写 Damage / PoiseDamage 元属性。\n\n物理材质来自 Context；距离取显式 Origin→HitResult.ImpactPoint。没有 HitResult 时距离为 0，不读取 EffectCauser 的当前坐标。","x":1450,"y":351,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"health","type":"text","text":"5. HealthSet 更新生命/韧性；HealthComponent 发变化、破韧或死亡事件。\n\n调用：HealthSet::PreGameplayEffectExecute 免疫/无敌校验 → PostGameplayEffectExecute 清元属性并广播 → HealthComponent::HandleOutOfHealth。","x":960,"y":864,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cue","type":"text","text":"6. GA交付独立命中反馈载荷，不因免疫或有效GE被拒绝吞掉碰撞表现；必需GE/Spec失败传播仍是E14未完接缝。\n\nHitImpact::HandleGameplayCue → Resolve（K2前）；OnExecute → 再Resolve（Super前）。消费AggregatedTargetTags；默认要求原Context.HitResult，缺失拒绝，不自动回落Target。正常无Hit须BP显式位置模式；已知表面漏配默认拒绝。世界原点/Overlap合法。\n[[GGYGO_流程_HitImpact.canvas|接口、失败与反馈子流程]]","x":1450,"y":864,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"window","fromSide":"right","toNode":"trace","toSide":"left","label":"判定启用"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"trace","fromSide":"right","toNode":"effect","toSide":"left","label":"命中且未重复"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"effect","fromSide":"right","toNode":"execute","toSide":"left","label":"应用 GE"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"execute","fromSide":"right","toNode":"health","toSide":"left","label":"修改元属性"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"effect","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cue","toSide":"top","label":"交付独立反馈载荷；必需GE失败传播待E14"}
	]
}
